#!/bin/bash
#
# ce_control -- site-side red button for a hosted HTCondor-CE.
#
# Lets the administrator of an execution site stop a CE that submits into their
# batch system over ssh (the Bosco/blahp path), without needing any access to
# the CE itself.
#
# Deliberately self-contained: it sources nothing from ~/bosco, because
# `lockout` has to keep working after ~/bosco is broken, emptied, or gone.
#
# Copyright (c) HTCondor Team, Computer Sciences Department,
#   University of Wisconsin-Madison, WI.
